OL,3,GNEWSAEleven officers convicted of
OL,4,Acrimes still on police payroll, chief
OL,5,Aconfirms
OL,6,
OL,7,FEleven officers who have been convicted
OL,8,Fof crimes - including eight who have
OL,9,Fbeen violent towards women and girls -
OL,10,Fare still on the Police Scotland pay
OL,11,Froll.
OL,13,FIn a letter to the Scottish
OL,14,FParliament's justice committee, Chief
OL,15,FConstable Jo Farrell said there were
OL,16,Fother cases with "incontrovertible
OL,17,Fevidence" against officers, but they
OL,18,Fcannot be sacked quickly enough.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,429,420,260,160,0,100
