OL,3,GNEWSAEleven officers convicted of
OL,4,Acrimes still on police payroll, chief
OL,5,Aconfirms
OL,6,
OL,7,FFarrell also said the #4.5m annual cost
OL,8,Fof the 80 officers who are currently
OL,9,Fsuspended was down to "sluggish"
OL,10,Fconduct arrangements, as well as the
OL,11,Ftime necessary for cases to go through
OL,12,Fcourts.
OL,14,FShe described the state of affairs as
OL,15,F"intolerable" and called for a
OL,16,Fmodernisation of the police conduct
OL,17,Fregime.
